WEBVTT

00:00:15.430 --> 00:00:18.190
Kaoru! Kaoru!

00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:21.390
We're here, Kaoru.

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.550
It's totally late, isn't it.

00:00:29.550 --> 00:00:31.080
It is indeed.

00:00:31.080 --> 00:00:33.590
Actually, it's already morning.

00:00:33.590 --> 00:00:34.930
...she was...

00:00:36.380 --> 00:00:40.940
Princess Takiri was looking right at me then.

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:49.070
She told me to fly.

00:00:50.860 --> 00:00:52.440
Princess Takiri...

00:02:20.610 --> 00:02:24.900
<b>Katana Maidens</b>

00:02:25.510 --> 00:02:29.870
And so, the suppression of the aradama 
that appeared in Tsuzuki Ward is complete,

00:02:25.950 --> 00:02:31.370
<b>Episode 19  Call of the Evil God</b>

00:02:30.190 --> 00:02:32.270
and the noro was collected.

00:02:32.270 --> 00:02:35.700
There were no injuries, and there was 
only minor damage to the equipment.

00:02:35.700 --> 00:02:38.420
That is all for my report.

00:02:38.420 --> 00:02:41.020
I see. Good work.

00:02:46.040 --> 00:02:47.010
Kaoru?

00:02:48.840 --> 00:02:51.720
What is it? You may leave now.

00:02:51.720 --> 00:02:53.770
You have nothing else to say?

00:02:53.770 --> 00:02:56.450
I've already given you my gratitude.

00:02:56.450 --> 00:02:58.020
If you want special treatment or a vacation—

00:02:58.020 --> 00:02:58.730
I don't!

00:02:58.730 --> 00:03:00.290
Princess Tagitsu!

00:03:00.290 --> 00:03:02.110
It's already been a week since then.

00:03:02.420 --> 00:03:07.110
Meanwhile, what's up with you guys just 
giving us aradama suppression missions?

00:03:07.110 --> 00:03:10.660
What's wrong? Since when are 
you passionate about your work?

00:03:10.660 --> 00:03:14.250
They've already kicked our asses once.
 We gotta return the favor.

00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:19.500
You have some clue on their 
whereabouts, don't you?

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:23.250
I'll give you the info once it comes in.

00:03:26.350 --> 00:03:27.730
Let's go, Ellen.

00:03:33.150 --> 00:03:38.910
The girls must be feeling impatient,
 just like we are.

00:03:39.400 --> 00:03:41.310
It is embarrassing.

00:03:41.310 --> 00:03:43.710
Now that she has absorbed Princess Takiri,

00:03:43.710 --> 00:03:46.990
Princess Tagitsu has an 
overwhelming advantage.

00:03:46.990 --> 00:03:52.830
Nevertheless, with her not having made 
any move since then, that means...

00:03:54.140 --> 00:03:56.320
It is rather ominous.

00:03:58.200 --> 00:04:01.870
But if Princess Tagitsu 
isn't making any moves,

00:04:01.870 --> 00:04:04.230
then perhaps there's a way 
we can improve the situation?

00:04:04.230 --> 00:04:07.970
If they aren't going to make a move, 
it's all the more reason we should.

00:04:07.970 --> 00:04:12.930
Toji from Ayanokouji were also part of 
the attack on the Ministry of Defense.

00:04:12.930 --> 00:04:15.510
We should easily be able 
to follow their trail.

00:04:15.950 --> 00:04:19.020
That will most likely lead 
us to Princess Tagitsu.

00:04:19.020 --> 00:04:21.980
The Japanese police are efficient.

00:04:22.710 --> 00:04:24.690
If we just knew where she was...

00:04:24.690 --> 00:04:26.160
Would you go after her?

00:04:27.160 --> 00:04:28.910
Like you did then?

00:04:28.910 --> 00:04:30.450
Of course.

00:04:30.450 --> 00:04:32.910
We can't just let Princess Tagitsu
 run around unchecked.

00:04:33.500 --> 00:04:37.790
So you think you can just get by on 
feelings alone? That's rather foolish.

00:04:38.440 --> 00:04:39.470
Hiyori-chan!

00:04:39.470 --> 00:04:43.730
Six months ago, while Yukari-sama 
was deprived of physical freedom,

00:04:43.730 --> 00:04:46.840
she was holding back Princess Tagitsu's
 power from the inside,

00:04:47.220 --> 00:04:48.730
but now things are different.

00:04:49.310 --> 00:04:52.450
Princess Tagitsu has been released 
from the shackle that was Yukari-sama.

00:04:53.100 --> 00:04:57.970
With the six of you, no, plus myself and 
Suzuka, even if we had all eight of us...

00:04:58.880 --> 00:05:02.000
Goodness, and weren't you the 
one who was talking about

00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:04.370
taking on Princess Tagitsu all by yourself?

00:05:04.370 --> 00:05:05.610
Yeah, I was.

00:05:06.140 --> 00:05:10.470
Back then, I was willing to put my life 
on the line to stop Princess Tagitsu.

00:05:10.470 --> 00:05:12.990
But I came to my senses when you smacked me.

00:05:14.350 --> 00:05:15.870
Very well, then.

00:05:16.430 --> 00:05:20.670
That's why I can say this.
 Now isn't the time to make a move.

00:05:20.670 --> 00:05:24.080
You say that, but how long are 
we supposed to stay like this?

00:05:24.080 --> 00:05:26.630
Until the situation changes.

00:05:26.630 --> 00:05:28.250
That's taking things too easy.

00:05:28.650 --> 00:05:30.310
You don't need to worry.

00:05:30.310 --> 00:05:32.340
Our opponent is Princess Tagitsu.

00:05:32.630 --> 00:05:36.350
She's probably planning 
something for the near future.

00:05:39.130 --> 00:05:43.310
So the issue is just how 
she is going to strike.

00:05:43.310 --> 00:05:45.950
I can't even begin to imagine,

00:05:45.950 --> 00:05:48.710
but we've been making preparations 
so we'll be ready for any situation.

00:05:48.710 --> 00:05:49.500
Director!

00:05:49.910 --> 00:05:51.490
What's with the outburst?

00:05:51.490 --> 00:05:53.820
Forgive me, but on the television...

00:05:54.780 --> 00:05:56.160
Television?

00:05:59.110 --> 00:06:01.290
What is this?

00:06:01.290 --> 00:06:03.790
<i>My name is Princess Tagitsu.</i>

00:06:03.790 --> 00:06:07.790
<i>I am what you humans would call an aradama.</i>

00:06:08.250 --> 00:06:11.800
I can't believe she's showing 
herself so boldly like this.

00:06:12.470 --> 00:06:14.800
What is she planning to do?

00:06:14.800 --> 00:06:18.150
<i>I am hoping to coexist with humans,</i>

00:06:18.150 --> 00:06:21.060
<i>and I am here to make that a reality.</i>

00:06:21.610 --> 00:06:23.810
Coexist with humans?

00:06:23.810 --> 00:06:26.690
Her goal is to get revenge 
on humans, isn't it?

00:06:26.690 --> 00:06:30.820
Perhaps she's undergone some kind of change 
since she fused with Princess Takiri?

00:06:31.150 --> 00:06:32.240
No.

00:06:33.270 --> 00:06:34.570
Her eyes.

00:06:35.240 --> 00:06:37.600
They're different from Princess Takiri's.

00:06:37.600 --> 00:06:40.330
Princess Tagitsu doesn't see humans.

00:06:40.330 --> 00:06:42.740
<i>However, there are those among the humans</i>

00:06:40.330 --> 00:06:45.830
<b>Emergency Statement by the Cabinet and Aradama</b>

00:06:42.740 --> 00:06:45.830
<i>who do not wish to coexist with aradama.</i>

00:06:46.150 --> 00:06:51.340
Those who hold considerable power with 
the pretext of suppressing aradama,

00:06:52.190 --> 00:06:53.180
the Toji.

00:06:53.710 --> 00:06:57.340
<i>They have ignored my requests for dialogue</i>

00:06:57.620 --> 00:07:02.010
and tried to destroy me like an
aradama who does not understand words.

00:07:02.010 --> 00:07:06.480
I have simply fanned away the sparks 
that have fallen on my body.

00:07:07.470 --> 00:07:10.230
That is the truth of twenty years ago.

00:07:11.360 --> 00:07:13.360
How dare she spew such nonsense!

00:07:13.360 --> 00:07:17.010
Many citizens do not know the 
truth of the great disaster.

00:07:17.010 --> 00:07:19.170
If they were to believe any of this...

00:07:19.170 --> 00:07:21.740
The government would deny 
it before that would happen.

00:07:22.170 --> 00:07:25.390
They've agreed that they won't 
officially make an announcement.

00:07:23.710 --> 00:07:26.980
<i>Is there any evidence to 
support the current story?</i>

00:07:33.580 --> 00:07:36.470
I will be the one to assure you of that.

00:07:36.850 --> 00:07:38.500
Who's the old dude?

00:07:38.500 --> 00:07:42.100
What are you talking about?
 That's the chief cabinet secretary.

00:07:42.450 --> 00:07:44.670
I can't believe someone 
that high up is involved.

00:07:44.670 --> 00:07:47.120
The Japanese government also bears 
responsibility for the great disaster,

00:07:47.120 --> 00:07:49.390
because of their backdoor
 dealings with the US army.

00:07:49.390 --> 00:07:51.950
So she's threatened them 
with proof of that, huh?

00:07:51.950 --> 00:07:54.210
Far from denying Princess Tagitsu,

00:07:54.210 --> 00:07:58.270
they seem to be enhancing
 her credibility. I am shocked.

00:07:58.270 --> 00:08:03.390
<i>Also, I have brought along another person 
who can speak in depth about this as well.</i>

00:08:03.390 --> 00:08:05.160
The president of Renpu Girls' Academy,

00:08:05.160 --> 00:08:06.200
<b>Explanation of the Situation From Chief Cabinet Secretary Tanizaki</b>

00:08:05.160 --> 00:08:07.790
<b>Information on
 the Aradama</b>

00:08:06.060 --> 00:08:07.790
<i>Miss Takatsu Yukina.</i>

00:08:06.200 --> 00:08:07.790
<b>Special Sword Training School Renpu Girls' Academy President Takatsu Yukina</b>

00:08:11.560 --> 00:08:12.810
President...

00:08:13.710 --> 00:08:14.960
Yukina...

00:08:18.190 --> 00:08:23.470
It is true that Princess Tagitsu was the 
cause of the great disaster twenty years ago.

00:08:23.470 --> 00:08:26.930
However, she has accepted being restrained 
by the Sword Administration Bureau,

00:08:26.930 --> 00:08:30.480
since she does not wish to 
cause any further destruction.

00:08:31.270 --> 00:08:34.550
Furthermore, she has simply sought 
to quietly open a dialogue

00:08:34.550 --> 00:08:37.440
without resorting to violence.

00:08:37.860 --> 00:08:39.820
Having witnessed this,

00:08:39.820 --> 00:08:43.650
there are those among the Toji who 
have changed their way of thinking.

00:08:43.650 --> 00:08:47.890
Humans have established a civilized 
society through dialogue.

00:08:47.890 --> 00:08:51.120
And I myself am one of
those who wonder, then,

00:08:51.120 --> 00:08:54.690
if we could also to build 
a relationship of trust

00:08:55.320 --> 00:08:57.590
with an aradama seeking dialogue.

00:08:57.900 --> 00:09:01.390
<i>However, Origami Yukari is not.</i>

00:09:01.390 --> 00:09:05.720
<i>She ignored Princess Tagitsu's pleas 
and continued to keep her confined.</i>

00:09:05.720 --> 00:09:08.620
And that is when that appeared.

00:09:11.230 --> 00:09:16.150
Princess Ichikishima,
 another version of Princess Tagitsu

00:09:16.150 --> 00:09:18.480
produced by her doubt of humans.

00:09:18.830 --> 00:09:20.660
She's finally getting to the point.

00:09:20.660 --> 00:09:24.000
<i>When she split from Princess Tagitsu,</i>

00:09:24.000 --> 00:09:26.480
Princess Ichikishima tried 
to escape from Kamakura

00:09:26.480 --> 00:09:30.540
and noro was spread all over 
the Kanto area as a result.

00:09:30.540 --> 00:09:33.140
However, among the confusion,

00:09:33.140 --> 00:09:35.920
we would like to save Princess Tagitsu
together with the imperial guard,

00:09:36.240 --> 00:09:42.800
<i>as formed under the president of Ayanokouji, 
made up of the Toji of Ayanokouji.</i>

00:09:43.180 --> 00:09:46.800
"Imperial" is just another grandiose 
name they have given it.

00:09:46.800 --> 00:09:50.300
Are they trying to elevate 
Princess Tagitsu into a queen now?

00:09:51.420 --> 00:09:53.910
<i>Princess Ichikishima was 
prevented from escaping</i>

00:09:53.910 --> 00:09:56.940
<i>and is even now in the hands 
of the Administration Bureau.</i>

00:09:57.250 --> 00:10:02.120
<i>Her goal is simply to get revenge 
on humans and that alone.</i>

00:10:02.120 --> 00:10:04.450
<i>If her powers were released,</i>

00:10:04.450 --> 00:10:07.910
<i>it could bring about a disaster 
even greater than before.</i>

00:10:07.910 --> 00:10:13.610
<i>Origami Yukari still refuses to let 
go of such a dangerous entity.</i>

00:10:14.710 --> 00:10:16.470
The only way to prevent a tragedy

00:10:16.470 --> 00:10:20.780
is for Princess Ichikishima and 
Princess Tagitsu to be fused back together.

00:10:21.180 --> 00:10:25.430
For that reason, we, the Sword
 Administration Bureau Restoration Faction,

00:10:25.430 --> 00:10:28.430
will set up our base here in Tokyo!

00:10:28.790 --> 00:10:30.820
We also have a demand.

00:10:30.820 --> 00:10:34.020
Origami Yukari and the Sword Administration

00:10:34.020 --> 00:10:37.400
must hand Princess Ichikishima
 over to us immediately.

00:10:37.400 --> 00:10:42.830
If you continue to put the people
 in danger, we will respond with force!

00:10:47.010 --> 00:10:50.690
So President Takatsu and 
Ayanokouji's President Souraku

00:10:50.690 --> 00:10:52.740
are on Princess Tagitsu's side after all.

00:10:53.690 --> 00:10:56.250
This will split the Five Schools apart.

00:10:57.750 --> 00:10:59.360
Yuzuki-senpai...

00:11:07.530 --> 00:11:09.790
It's been three days since that broadcast.

00:11:10.260 --> 00:11:14.340
All the Toji from Ayanokouji 
are leaving Kyoto.

00:11:14.340 --> 00:11:19.520
They're being ordered to by
 Ayanokouji's president. It's inevitable.

00:11:23.730 --> 00:11:27.790
I wonder if some of them will 
join the imperial guard.

00:11:31.200 --> 00:11:33.970
Speaking of, what is going on with Renpu?

00:11:33.970 --> 00:11:35.910
Have you heard anything 
from President Takatsu?

00:11:38.990 --> 00:11:40.940
You don't need to worry about Renpu.

00:11:41.500 --> 00:11:44.850
Sana-sensei has been acting as president.

00:11:45.590 --> 00:11:49.790
President Takatsu has no authority 
as president for now, right?

00:11:49.790 --> 00:11:52.430
Nominally, she is still president.

00:11:52.430 --> 00:11:55.250
Her successor will be designated next spring,

00:11:55.250 --> 00:11:58.310
and then she'll be the former president 
in both name and substance.

00:11:58.310 --> 00:12:02.990
Can we even be sure that the new 
president will be on our side?

00:12:03.580 --> 00:12:06.360
The government is supporting their side.

00:12:06.360 --> 00:12:11.070
That's true, but while Princess Tagitsu has 
been currying favor with the government,

00:12:11.070 --> 00:12:14.500
there are those among the 
higher-ups who know the truth.

00:12:14.500 --> 00:12:17.550
Things won't go as easily as they think.

00:12:17.550 --> 00:12:19.460
Or that's what my grandpa said.

00:12:19.760 --> 00:12:23.170
My father has also been working 
on things here and there.

00:12:23.170 --> 00:12:28.080
I still can't stand sitting around waiting 
when we know where Princess Tagitsu is.

00:12:28.080 --> 00:12:32.430
But if we marched in there now, it would 
just be a fight between Toji, Kaoru.

00:12:32.430 --> 00:12:36.430
<b>From
Director Maniwa
Mission Summary
Status - Emergency Call
Time - Around 4:18 PM
Location - Near Kinuta Park, Setagaya Ward, Tokyo
Mission Details
Eight calls with aradama concerns.
Etou Kanami and Itomi Sayaka are to rush to the scene with standard equipment.
Assess the situation and begin suppressive action.
The rear guard will be deployed to the north.
End</b>

00:12:33.100 --> 00:12:34.740
Kanami-chan, dispatch orders?

00:12:34.740 --> 00:12:37.700
Yeah, an aradama has been spotted 
in the metropolitan area.

00:12:37.700 --> 00:12:39.970
The director has ordered 
Sayaka-chan and I to go.

00:12:39.970 --> 00:12:41.940
Even at a time like this...

00:12:42.380 --> 00:12:45.940
The aradama are not concerned 
with our circumstances.

00:12:45.940 --> 00:12:47.650
Let's go, Sayaka-chan.

00:12:47.650 --> 00:12:48.570
Right.

00:12:48.570 --> 00:12:52.750
All we can do for now is exterminate 
the aradama in front of us.

00:13:01.290 --> 00:13:04.040
What's going on at Kamakura?

00:13:04.040 --> 00:13:06.190
Nothing is going on.

00:13:06.190 --> 00:13:09.200
They do not have the nerve to attack us here.

00:13:09.200 --> 00:13:10.340
I see.

00:13:10.640 --> 00:13:14.590
The Toji are mostly focusing on 
exterminating aradama for now,

00:13:14.590 --> 00:13:17.850
but who knows how much longer 
they will be doing that?

00:13:19.890 --> 00:13:21.600
There, all finished.

00:13:23.510 --> 00:13:25.450
You look lovely.

00:13:26.360 --> 00:13:28.870
I am going out on business.

00:13:28.870 --> 00:13:33.490
There are guards on duty, but please 
be sure to take care of yourself.

00:13:33.880 --> 00:13:35.950
Who do you think you're speaking to?

00:13:35.950 --> 00:13:40.660
M-My apologies! I am just 
concerned for your well being.

00:13:40.660 --> 00:13:42.750
That is enough. Leave.

00:14:09.570 --> 00:14:11.520
Sayaka-chan, it should be just ahead!

00:14:11.520 --> 00:14:12.210
Okay.

00:14:13.900 --> 00:14:15.200
What's wrong?

00:14:15.200 --> 00:14:17.090
The aradama's signal is...

00:14:17.500 --> 00:14:20.950
No other units besides us
 should've been dispatched.

00:14:21.500 --> 00:14:22.860
Let's go take a look.

00:14:24.110 --> 00:14:27.470
Yes, please begin collecting the noro.

00:14:28.830 --> 00:14:30.140
Ayumu-chan?

00:14:30.940 --> 00:14:32.300
What are you doing here?

00:14:32.300 --> 00:14:34.740
Etou-san! And Itomi-san!

00:14:34.740 --> 00:14:38.420
You're so late! We've already handled it.

00:14:38.420 --> 00:14:40.850
Ayumu-chan, are you okay?

00:14:40.850 --> 00:14:43.770
Huh? What do you mean?

00:14:45.400 --> 00:14:46.800
What are you doing here?

00:14:46.800 --> 00:14:48.980
Our job, obviously.

00:14:48.980 --> 00:14:51.940
Destroying aradama is a 
Toji's duty, isn't it?

00:14:51.940 --> 00:14:53.780
Princess Tagitsu is an aradama, too.

00:14:53.780 --> 00:14:58.030
Princess Tagitsu-sama is different, 
since she is a goddess.

00:14:59.790 --> 00:15:00.950
Captain Uchizato!

00:15:00.950 --> 00:15:03.300
We're ready to withdraw.

00:15:03.300 --> 00:15:05.540
Too bad, I have to go already.

00:15:05.540 --> 00:15:09.200
Let's fight together again 
next time, Etou-san!

00:15:20.510 --> 00:15:24.140
They seriously mean to split 
the administration in two, huh?

00:15:24.140 --> 00:15:26.690
They were also collecting noro.

00:15:26.690 --> 00:15:31.190
They're supposed to be based 
in the Tokyo Station Hotel.

00:15:31.190 --> 00:15:33.350
It couldn't store noro.

00:15:33.350 --> 00:15:36.400
I can't really imagine that 
they're enshrining it, either.

00:15:37.340 --> 00:15:38.660
Then...

00:15:38.660 --> 00:15:42.160
Is Princess Tagitsu just absorbing them?

00:15:44.430 --> 00:15:46.370
Did you report this to the director?

00:15:46.370 --> 00:15:48.320
Of course I did,

00:15:48.320 --> 00:15:52.460
but she told us to be careful not 
to openly take aggressive actions.

00:15:52.890 --> 00:15:56.450
Even if there's a possibility that 
Princess Tagitsu is gathering power?

00:15:56.450 --> 00:15:59.630
Yeah, it seems like the 
order comes from above.

00:15:59.630 --> 00:16:01.910
Ugh! I can't take this anymore!

00:16:01.910 --> 00:16:03.010
Nene, let's go!

00:16:04.060 --> 00:16:05.470
Where are you going?

00:16:05.470 --> 00:16:07.310
To talk directly with the director.

00:16:07.950 --> 00:16:10.900
Sana-sensei has apparently gone out.

00:16:10.900 --> 00:16:13.730
Huh? Where did she go?

00:16:13.730 --> 00:16:16.230
<b>National Public Safety Commission
National Police Agency</b>

00:16:25.130 --> 00:16:29.660
It has been a while, Director Maniwa.

00:16:30.840 --> 00:16:31.790
Yes.

00:16:33.610 --> 00:16:35.430
Did you hear?

00:16:35.430 --> 00:16:38.630
Your side handled the aradama 
in the metropolitan area.

00:16:38.630 --> 00:16:43.380
Yes. If you wish, we can 
expand our range even more.

00:16:43.380 --> 00:16:46.140
Does your side have enough 
fighting power for that?

00:16:46.140 --> 00:16:49.120
Our Toji are quite skilled.

00:16:49.120 --> 00:16:52.610
Which reminds me, have you
 finished cleaning it up?

00:16:53.560 --> 00:16:56.270
The director's room.

00:16:56.270 --> 00:16:59.030
It will be mine in the new future.

00:17:02.540 --> 00:17:07.080
Please be sure not to leave 
behind Yukari-sama's stench.

00:17:07.080 --> 00:17:09.900
I don't care for her.

00:17:16.470 --> 00:17:18.960
<i>I've heard from Admiral.</i>

00:17:18.960 --> 00:17:20.230
Admiral?

00:17:20.230 --> 00:17:24.390
<i>It's an online handle. He's been 
a chat room friend for years.</i>

00:17:24.390 --> 00:17:29.410
<i>According to him, apparently my native 
country has abandoned the <i>Nautilus</i>.</i>

00:17:30.220 --> 00:17:32.470
<i>A submarine whose nationality is unknown</i>

00:17:32.470 --> 00:17:35.650
<i>can be seized in Japan's territorial waters.</i>

00:17:35.650 --> 00:17:37.950
Is President Takatsu behind this, too?

00:17:37.950 --> 00:17:41.690
<i>I would love to challenge her 
to a game of chess just once.</i>

00:17:48.040 --> 00:17:49.370
Who are you?

00:17:49.370 --> 00:17:51.200
The former elite guard.

00:17:52.520 --> 00:17:54.000
Wait.

00:17:56.350 --> 00:17:58.030
I will handle this.

00:17:59.270 --> 00:18:01.530
Yomi, confirm something for me.

00:18:02.010 --> 00:18:07.180
Are you truly working with 
Princess Tagitsu of your own free will?

00:18:07.830 --> 00:18:08.930
Yes.

00:18:08.930 --> 00:18:14.450
You aren't lending her your strength 
reluctantly for some reason, are you?

00:18:14.450 --> 00:18:15.440
No.

00:18:15.750 --> 00:18:18.410
Okay, then. Got it.

00:18:19.560 --> 00:18:21.820
I have just one more question to ask you.

00:18:22.510 --> 00:18:23.950
What is it?

00:18:24.670 --> 00:18:28.300
Do you think Yume was happy?

00:18:30.710 --> 00:18:31.490
Yes.

00:18:32.240 --> 00:18:33.390
I see.

00:18:34.710 --> 00:18:37.960
Then it seems our paths 
have diverged after all.

00:18:40.220 --> 00:18:42.110
What about you?

00:18:43.900 --> 00:18:46.470
Are you happy now?

00:18:49.560 --> 00:18:51.020
I'm not sure.

00:18:58.740 --> 00:19:01.730
<i>The submarine that Princess 
Ichikishima is believed to be on</i>

00:18:58.940 --> 00:19:08.620
<b>Emergency
 Broadcast</b>

00:18:59.730 --> 00:19:08.620
<b>The submarine containing the aradama Princess Ichikishima has been spotted near the Boso Peninsula</b>

00:19:01.730 --> 00:19:04.080
<i>is sailing off the coast 
of the Boso Peninsula.</i>

00:19:04.080 --> 00:19:08.620
<i>It is a sight reminiscent of the appearance 
of the great aradama six months ago.</i>

00:19:08.620 --> 00:19:10.420
Is this your doing?

00:19:10.420 --> 00:19:13.910
<i>It's pointless to search for a criminal 
that's already in our backyard, isn't it?</i>

00:19:13.910 --> 00:19:14.740
What?

00:19:14.740 --> 00:19:19.000
<i>The problem is how will the government cope 
with the location of Princess Ichikishima</i>

00:19:19.000 --> 00:19:21.750
being exposed to the public.

00:19:22.080 --> 00:19:24.050
I wonder what the public would think

00:19:24.050 --> 00:19:28.930
if the government continues to leave 
such a dangerous entity in the care of

00:19:28.930 --> 00:19:31.260
the Sword Administration Bureau, 
which is losing their trust?

00:19:31.570 --> 00:19:34.800
Which means it's more sensible 
for Princess Ichikishima to be

00:19:34.800 --> 00:19:39.400
under the government's control, even if 
it requires using somewhat coercive means.

00:19:39.400 --> 00:19:42.100
Are you trying to threaten us?

00:19:42.100 --> 00:19:43.690
<i>As it is,</i>

00:19:44.020 --> 00:19:48.240
I do not believe you have too 
many other options left to take.

00:19:50.490 --> 00:19:51.660
<i>Understood.</i>

00:19:55.190 --> 00:19:59.250
Yomi, summon all of the 
imperial guard immediately!

00:19:59.250 --> 00:20:02.250
<b>Emergency
 Broadcast</b>

00:19:59.250 --> 00:20:02.250
<b>The submarine containing the aradama Princess Ichikishima has been spotted near the Boso Peninsula</b>

00:19:59.630 --> 00:20:04.250
<i>A submarine that is believed to have 
Princess Ichikishima on board was spotted</i>

00:20:04.250 --> 00:20:07.760
off the coast of the Boso Peninsula, and it
 is still heading northeast at a low speed.

00:20:14.390 --> 00:20:17.390
<b>AR02-05-5 Naa @ Director
AR47-03-E KANAMI Samurai III</b>

00:20:14.390 --> 00:20:17.390
<b>I've gotten word from Rui,
who has been working with Yukari-senpai.
Wait at the Renpu dorm until
I send you an emergency call.
FROM: Naa @ Director</b>

00:20:20.750 --> 00:20:22.400
President Souraku!

00:20:22.910 --> 00:20:24.080
Uchizato...

00:20:24.080 --> 00:20:28.150
Um, it's a bit late for this, 
but I wanted to thank you.

00:20:28.150 --> 00:20:29.200
Thank me?

00:20:29.200 --> 00:20:31.570
My dream has come true!

00:20:31.570 --> 00:20:34.370
The dream where I wanted 
to fight with Etou-san.

00:20:34.370 --> 00:20:36.450
I wish you could've seen it, too!

00:20:36.450 --> 00:20:40.170
Etou-san wasn't able to land
 even a single hit on me!

00:20:40.570 --> 00:20:41.700
I see.

00:20:41.700 --> 00:20:46.180
All of it has been thanks
 to you, President, so thank you!

00:20:46.180 --> 00:20:47.180
I'm off!

00:20:51.450 --> 00:20:55.280
Investigation inside the target ship
 is complete, but there is no one aboard.

00:20:55.280 --> 00:20:57.560
I repeat, there is no one aboard!

00:21:01.560 --> 00:21:04.900
Man, it's nice to be on land 
where it isn't shaking.

00:21:05.190 --> 00:21:07.990
I just can't handle travel by boat.

00:21:07.990 --> 00:21:10.110
Oh, but that was a submarine.

00:21:10.910 --> 00:21:14.120
This is as far as I go. Take care.

00:21:14.120 --> 00:21:15.830
Thank you.

00:21:15.830 --> 00:21:18.590
Please let Professor Friedman know as well.

00:21:18.590 --> 00:21:20.370
We escaped thanks to you.

00:21:21.290 --> 00:21:22.540
I will.

00:21:26.420 --> 00:21:28.870
Princess, you will be pleased.

00:21:28.870 --> 00:21:31.290
We found out where Princess 
Ichikishima landed.

00:21:34.760 --> 00:21:37.030
Are you not going to wear it?

00:21:37.030 --> 00:21:39.060
This is much easier to move in.

00:21:39.060 --> 00:21:41.940
There is no need for you to go out.

00:21:42.350 --> 00:21:46.520
I will have Princess Ichikishima 
brought here to you.

00:21:46.910 --> 00:21:50.780
I see. Then I will wait, for now.

00:21:50.780 --> 00:21:54.780
Yes, I am sure we will 
have good news for you.

00:23:34.840 --> 00:23:39.840
<b>Next Episode  The Last Goddess</b>
